Package: BFRdist
Type: Package
Title: The BFR Distribution for Bounded Measurements
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Luo", role = "aut"),
    person("Jennifer", "Hanna", email = "jennifer.suzanne.hanna@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Maintainer: Jennifer Hanna <jennifer.suzanne.hanna@gmail.com>
Description: Implements the novel BFR distribution, a highly flexible and analytically tractable model for continuous data strictly bounded on the unit interval. Serving as a robust alternative to the Beta and Kumaraswamy distributions, this package provides closed-form quantile functions, rapid parameter estimation, and order-statistic diagnostics for a wide variety of bounded data, including proportions, probabilities, and normalized indices, with specific applications in Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) data.
